  "why": "numpy and Pillow are pinned (with hashes) in .github/requirements/repo-hygiene.txt, a lock that the dispatch-only build workflows (Windows.yml, Linux.yml, macOS-Intel.yml, macOS-Arm64.yml) install as well as the PR-time hygiene job. Every one of them installs with --only-binary=:all: --require-hashes on the interpreter in .python-version (3.13), so each runner needs a prebuilt cp313 wheel of both pins or the install fails. PR checks never run the build workflows, so this file is the standing proof; test_look_judge_harness.CiPinsTests ties it to the workflows and to the lock.",
